  "bodyHash": "1675fbe9a9f657d9",
  "content": "\n\n<p>本模組以《JOJO的奇妙冒險》為基礎！&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><span>將替身能力融入劍中！<br><br>探索世界，尋找隕石，製作箭矢，獲得你的替身劍<br><br>YouTube：<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@SpoduoPablo/videos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@SpoduoPablo/videos</a><br><br>1.3.sp<br></span></pre>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>替身箭、替身箭鎮魂曲、白金之星劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/989/438/a.png\" alt=\"版本1，第三部，白金之星\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.3.mr</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>隕石、替身箭素材、魔術師之紅劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/989/807/2024-10-13_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;1.3.3<br></span></pre>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>隱者之紫劍、&nbsp;世界劍、&nbsp;法皇之綠劍、&nbsp;銀色戰車劍、&nbsp;愚者劍<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/990/292/2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;1.3.4<br></span></pre>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>灰塔劍、&nbsp;暗藍之月劍、&nbsp;倒吊人劍、&nbsp;皇帝<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/990/702/kkk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;1.3.5<br></span></pre>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>喬納森的替身劍、正義之劍<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/991/812/abc.png\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.3.6</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>戀人劍、太陽劍、十三死亡鐮刀、蓋布劍、阿努比斯劍、奶油劍、公園<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/993/33/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;1.4</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>瘋狂鑽石劍、手劍、天堂之門劍、迴聲蛋</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/994/263/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;1.4.1<br></span></pre>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>迴聲ACT1、2、3劍與殺手皇后劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/994/590/swordechoes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;1.4.2<br></span></pre>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>水之項鍊劍、&nbsp;紅熱辣椒劍、&nbsp;珍珠果醬劍、&nbsp;Achtung Baby劍、&nbsp;ratt、&nbsp;高速公路之星劍 (開發中)、&nbsp;珍珠果醬水、&nbsp;珍珠果醬馬蘇里拉起司與番茄、&nbsp;珍珠果醬主菜、&nbsp;珍珠果醬蘋果泥燉羊肉、&nbsp;珍珠果醬布丁<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/345/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;1.5<br></span></pre>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>黃金體驗、黃金體驗鎮魂曲</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/998/597/aaaaaaaa.png\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.5.1</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>鋼鏈手指劍、性手槍、空中鐵匠劍、紫色迷霧劍、緋紅之王劍、黑色安息日劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1003/586/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;1.5.2<br></span></pre>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;Kraft Work劍、&nbsp;感恩而死劍、&nbsp;臭名昭著B.I.G劍、&nbsp;金屬樂隊劍、&nbsp;綠日劍<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1004/442/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;1.6<br></span></pre>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>銀色戰車鎮魂曲劍、&nbsp;石之自由劍、&nbsp;親吻劍、&nbsp;Foo Fighters劍、&nbsp;天氣報告劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1005/819/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.6.1</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>白蛇劍、碟片 (46張)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1008/246/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.6.2</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Green, Green Grass of Home劍、&nbsp;C-Moon劍、&nbsp;天堂製造劍、&nbsp;行星波浪劍、&nbsp;牙劍、碟片 (3張)<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1009/693/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;1.6.3</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>力量劍、黑惡魔劍、黃色節制劍、皇后劍、命運之輪、審判劍、「金錠」、「鑽石塊」、女祭司劍、碟片 (7張)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1010/402/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;1.6.4</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>庫努姆劍、托特、巴斯特法杖、塞特斧、碟片 (4張)。26顆頭部 (庫努姆劍掉落物)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1012/463/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.6.5</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>奧西里斯劍、&nbsp;籌碼、荷魯斯劍、&nbsp;阿圖姆劍、&nbsp;玩偶、&nbsp;霍莉的替身劍、&nbsp;Love Deluxe劍、&nbsp;碟片 (5張)、&nbsp;金屬樂隊鐵刃 (金屬樂隊劍稀有掉落物)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/135/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.6.6</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>收割之劍、&nbsp;壞公司、&nbsp;鎖劍、&nbsp;灰姑娘劍、&nbsp;流浪貓劍、&nbsp;Super Fly劍、&nbsp;謎之劍、&nbsp;Cheap Trick劍、&nbsp;辣妹劍、&nbsp;碟片 (9張)，3種材質重繪</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/749/1.png\" width=\"445\" height=\"233\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>新標誌</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/768/design-sem-nome.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"445\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.6.7</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>憂鬱藍調劍、&nbsp;總統先生劍、&nbsp;Soft Machine劍、&nbsp;小腳劍、&nbsp;氣球、&nbsp;碟片 (4張)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/185/2024-11-14_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/186/2024-11-14_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.6.8</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;鏡中人劍、&nbsp;海灘男孩、&nbsp;娃娃臉、&nbsp;娃娃臉劍、&nbsp;白色專輯胸甲、&nbsp;綠洲胸甲、&nbsp;衝突劍、&nbsp;Talking Head劍、&nbsp;肉塊、&nbsp;碟片 (7張)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/583/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.6.8.1</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Burning Down the House劍、幽靈手槍、幽靈蛋糕、幽靈餅乾、幽靈果汁、碟片 (1張)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1015/276/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.6.9</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>潛水員劍、&nbsp;Goo Goo Dolls劍、&nbsp;曼哈頓轉移、&nbsp;地獄公路劍、滾石劍、碟片(5張)<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1018/904/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.6.10</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>瑪麗蓮曼森劍、&nbsp;Jumpin' Jack Flash劍、&nbsp;Limp Bizkit劍、&nbsp;倖存者、&nbsp;龍之夢劍、&nbsp;馬友友劍、&nbsp;監獄鎖劍、&nbsp;天際劍、&nbsp;地下世界劍、&nbsp;沸水替身劍、&nbsp;碟片 (10張)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1021/491/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.7</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>牙ACT2劍、&nbsp;空洞、&nbsp;牙鎬、&nbsp;牙ACT3劍、&nbsp;牙ACT4劍、&nbsp;碎球劍、&nbsp;聖遺物碎片、&nbsp;惡魔之掌結構、&nbsp;黃金矩形</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1021/938/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1021/939/devilpalm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;1.7.1</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Ticket to Ride劍、&nbsp;Oh! Lonesome Me劍、&nbsp;Scary Monsters劍、&nbsp;奶油啟動器<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1022/830/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.7.2</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>D4C劍、In a Silent Way劍、D4C愛之列車劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1023/444/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.7.3</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Hey Ya!劍、&nbsp;Boku no Rhythm wo Kiitekure劍、&nbsp;Catch the Rainbow劍、&nbsp;20th Century BOY劍、&nbsp;Soft &amp; Wet劍<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1024/3/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.8</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>殺手皇后8劍、&nbsp;虛無之王劍、&nbsp;行走之心劍、&nbsp;奇蹟於你劍、&nbsp;碟片 (4張)<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1025/337/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.9</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Schott Key No.2劍、&nbsp;Milagroman劍、&nbsp;Brain Storm劍、&nbsp;隱者之紫8劍、&nbsp;November Rain劍、&nbsp;天堂之門9劍、&nbsp;Cat Size劍、&nbsp;Gucci包替身、&nbsp;Charmy Green劍、&nbsp;天堂之世界劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1026/907/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;1.9.1</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Tomb of the Boom 1劍、&nbsp;Tomb of the Boom 2劍、&nbsp;Tomb of the Boom 3劍、&nbsp;Wired、&nbsp;Mandom、&nbsp;Tubular Bells、&nbsp;Tubular Bells劍、&nbsp;Civil War劍、&nbsp;Chocolate Disco、&nbsp;Paisley Park劍、&nbsp;Remote Romance劍、碟片 (2張)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1028/229/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.9.3</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Doggy Style劍、&nbsp;California King Bed劍、&nbsp;Born This Way劍、&nbsp;Nut King Call劍、&nbsp;Paper Moon King劍、&nbsp;Speed King劍、&nbsp;Love Love Deluxe劍、&nbsp;Space Trucking劍、&nbsp;King Card、&nbsp;Awaking III Leaves劍、&nbsp;Fun Fun Fun劍、&nbsp;Les Feuilles劍、&nbsp;I Am a Rock劍、&nbsp;Doobie Wah!劍、&nbsp;Schott Key No.1劍、&nbsp;Vitamin C劍、&nbsp;Blue Hawaii劍、&nbsp;Ozon Baby House、&nbsp;Ozon Baby劍、&nbsp;Doctor Wu劍、&nbsp;Smooth Operators劍、&nbsp;THE MATTEKUDASAI劍、&nbsp;Bigmouth Strikes Again劍、&nbsp;碟片 (22張)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1029/415/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;1.9.3</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>新增自然資源工人替身劍，完成 Schott Key No.1劍，新增音效至：(白金之星劍、世界劍、阿努比斯劍、殺手皇后劍、辣妹劍、白蛇劍、殺手皇后8劍、Scary Monsters劍)，材質變更至：(隕石、替身箭素材、正義之劍、十三死亡鐮刀)，新增碟片(1張)，新增替身物品創造標籤頁</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1030/236/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.9.4</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>殭屍替身劍、&nbsp;召喚殭屍Boss、&nbsp;碟片 (1張)、&nbsp;殭屍營地結構、&nbsp;殭屍營地地下結構、&nbsp;新增擊殺音效至：(魔術師之紅劍、隱者之紫劍、愚者劍、灰塔劍、暗藍之月劍、倒吊人劍、皇帝、喬納森的替身劍、正義之劍、戀人劍、太陽劍、蓋布劍、瘋狂鑽石劍、水之項鍊劍、紅熱辣椒劍、珍珠果醬劍、ratt、性手槍、Foo Fighters劍、皇后劍、Talking Head劍、沸水替身劍、Charmy Green劍、Speed King劍、謎之手槍、幽靈手槍、行星波浪劍)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1031/381/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1031/380/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.9.4.1</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>新增替身箭素材方塊，修復野貓尺寸成就，新增擊殺特效與音效至：(C-Moon劍、天堂製造劍、自然資源工人替身劍、Cat Size劍、龍之夢劍、Talking Head劍、衝突劍、監獄鎖劍、Soft Machine劍、臭名昭著B.I.G劍)，修復白金之星劍與&nbsp;世界劍，強化&nbsp;法皇之綠劍，強化殭屍Boss</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1034/100/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1034/101/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;1.9.4.2</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Bags Groove、碟片(1張)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1045/859/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>3.0 (1.20.1)</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>替身箭、&nbsp;替身箭鎮魂曲、&nbsp;白金之星劍、&nbsp;隕石、&nbsp;星輝錠、&nbsp;星輝塊、&nbsp;魔術師之紅劍、&nbsp;隱者之紫劍、&nbsp;世界劍、&nbsp;隕石結構</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1045/763/3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1045/760/3.png\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>3.1 (1.20.1)</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>原始星輝、&nbsp;原始星輝塊、&nbsp;法皇之綠劍、&nbsp;銀色戰車劍、&nbsp;愚者劍、&nbsp;灰塔劍、&nbsp;暗藍之月劍、&nbsp;倒吊人劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1046/645/3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>3.2 (1.20.1)</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>皇帝、&nbsp;喬納森的替身劍、&nbsp;正義之劍、&nbsp;戀人劍、&nbsp;太陽劍、&nbsp;天堂之世界劍、&nbsp;十三死亡鐮刀、&nbsp;銀色戰車鎮魂曲劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1046/898/3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>3.3 (1.20.1)</p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>盖布剑,&nbsp;阿努比斯剑,&nbsp;奶油剑,&nbsp;疯