 (1.20.1)</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>杀手皇后8剑,&nbsp;天堂制造剑（天堂制造的改良版）,&nbsp;虚无之王剑,&nbsp;行走之心剑,&nbsp;奇迹于你剑,&nbsp;肖特键No.2剑,&nbsp;坏公司,&nbsp;奇迹人剑,&nbsp;头脑风暴剑,&nbsp;隐者之紫8剑,&nbsp;十一月雨剑,&nbsp;唱片(9)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1063/263/8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;8.1 (1.20.1)</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>天堂之门9剑,&nbsp;猫体型剑,&nbsp;古驰包替身,&nbsp;翠绿魅力剑,&nbsp;爆炸坟墓1、2和3剑,&nbsp;威胁粒子与效果,&nbsp;连线,&nbsp;玛南多姆,&nbsp;管钟,&nbsp;管钟剑,&nbsp;内战剑,&nbsp;巧克力迪斯科,&nbsp;佩斯利公园剑,&nbsp;远程浪漫剑,&nbsp;狗式剑,&nbsp;加州国王床剑,&nbsp;天生如此剑,&nbsp;唱片(9)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1064/781/8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1064/786/8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;9.0 (1.20.1)</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>坚果王呼唤剑,&nbsp;纸月亮国王剑,&nbsp;速度之王剑,&nbsp;爱爱豪华剑,&nbsp;太空卡车运输剑,&nbsp;国王牌,&nbsp;觉醒III树叶剑,&nbsp;欢乐欢乐欢乐剑,&nbsp;树叶剑,&nbsp;我是岩石剑,&nbsp;杜比哇剑,&nbsp;肖特键No.1剑,&nbsp;维生素C剑,&nbsp;蓝色夏威夷剑,&nbsp;臭氧宝宝屋,&nbsp;臭氧宝宝剑,&nbsp;吴医生剑,&nbsp;流畅操作者剑,&nbsp;THE MATTEKUDASAI剑,&nbsp;胡斯尔,&nbsp;大嘴巴再次出击剑,&nbsp;自然资源工人替身剑,&nbsp;包袋律动剑,&nbsp;唱片(22)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1067/163/9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>9.1 (1.20.1)</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>僵尸首领召唤,&nbsp;僵尸替身剑,&nbsp;营地结构,&nbsp;纯净铁块,&nbsp;腐化方块（68种变体）,&nbsp;随机剑,&nbsp;迪奥·布兰度首领,&nbsp;璀璨骨刃,&nbsp;强光粒子,&nbsp;光骨刃效果,&nbsp;卡兹首领,&nbsp;吉良吉影首领,&nbsp;迪亚波罗首领,&nbsp;恩里克·普奇首领,&nbsp;富尼耶·瓦伦丁首领, ?,&nbsp;按键“R”“随机剑切换模式”</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1071/774/9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1071/775/9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1071/773/9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
